    "scenesThatPass": [
      "CHELSEA: Hey! Anybody home?\nETHEL: Too late! Ethel opens the back door and rushes out.",
      "ETHEL: Dear Chelsea. I'm so glad you're home.\nCHELSEA: I thought we'd never get here. We rented a car that explodes every forty miles.",
      "CHELSEA: Oh. I don't know. Red, I think.\nETHEL: Ooh! A red car!",
      "CHELSEA: Um. I don't know.\nETHEL: She doesn't know, dear. It doesn't matter.",
      "CHELSEA: Yeah. Well... She looks about, smiles at her \"Welcome Home\" sign.\nETHEL: Where's your friend? You did bring your friend, didn't you?\nCHELSEA: I knew I was forgetting something. She steps to the door."
    ]
